# This only affects uploads from the Vercel CLI; for repository-connected deploys the
# project's Root Directory setting is the real control.
# Only frontend/ is ever built and deployed from a Vercel project (Root Directory:
# frontend). Everything else here is never part of a deployment, and spikes/ holds
# unauthenticated routes that use the Turnkey root key.
spikes/
services/
supabase/
ops/
docs/
